Federal Intermediated Securities Act (FISA)
SR 957.1 — Federal Act of 3 October 2008 on Intermediated Securities (Federal Intermediated Securities Act, FISA).
|

:NOTE [links:https://fedlex.data.admin.ch/eli/cc/2009/450]
